# 2026-09-27 18:05:33.717653
+Implement job health grace period enforcement:
+
+1. Add jobHealthGracePeriod field to the Player model to track years below health requirement
+2. Add a helper function to check job health requirements and update grace period
+3. Integrate health requirement checks into the yearCycle:
+   - Check if player's current health is below their job's minHealth requirement
+   - If below requirement for first time (year 0), increment grace period counter and notify player
+   - If already in grace period and still below requirement at year end, auto-fire the job
+4. Add test to verify: notification on first year below, and auto-firing on second year if still below
+
+This implements the 1-year grace period as documented in Game_Instructions.md:28-29

# 2026-09-27 18:11:07.573788
+Implement job health grace period enforcement system:
+
+1. In jobs.ts, add a new helper function `checkJobHealthRequirement()` that:
+   - Takes a player object and their active job
+   - Returns an object with {meetsRequirement, gracePeriodYear, recommendedAction}
+   - Handles when player health is below job's minHealth requirement
+
+2. In yearCycle.ts, integrate grace period enforcement into the startNewYear function:
+   - After job annual checks, check if any active employments have health requirements not met
+   - If health is below requirement:
+     - If gracePeriodYear is 0: increment jobHealthGracePeriod to 1, send first-year warning notification
+     - If gracePeriodYear >= 1 and still below: fire the job with endReason='fired_health', send notification
+   - Reset gracePeriodYear to 0 if health is back above requirement
+
+This implements the 1-year grace period as documented in Game_Instructions.md:28-29
